{"id":"rude","lemma":"rude","pos":"adj","rank":3842,"glosses":["rough, harsh","tough, hard; severe","bitter, harsh, sharp (of weather)"],"ipa":"/ʁyd/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c5/Fr-rude.ogg/Fr-rude.ogg.mp3","forms":{"plural":"rudes"},"examples":[{"text":"La journée a été rude.","en":"It's been a rough day.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"day"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"summer"},null]},{"text":"Il a de rudes manières.","en":"He has rough manners.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"of / from"},null,{"g":"manner, way","l":"manière"}]},{"text":"Les hivers étaient très rudes.","en":"The winters were bitterly cold.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"winter","l":"hiver"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"very"},null]},{"text":"Il est un peu rude aux encoignures.","en":"He's rough around the edges.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,null,null,{"g":"to the"},null],"phrases":[[2,4,"a little, a bit"]]},{"text":"Les choses vont peut-être être un peu rudes.","en":"Things might get a little rough.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"thing","l":"chose"},{"g":"to go","l":"aller"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"to be"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[6,8,"a little, a bit"]]}]}